#: 354d2e0fb29c46bdb99199c14ccf4900 5f10b8b07f15458b97d81f6fb5c687af
#: a0505fd5e1644ec2b13a9587babea7d0 cafc41dab3d44d62aeee994f8322f8cc
msgid "Magnetic Interference"
msgstr "磁场干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:7
#: 43be1d3d032e41eaaa3176023b0c1013 50bd13fbd20b48dca10cb9533e1d96de
#: 89e8648a8ee0499c9ff3993a768d8be6 e2f5bca9096d4c4c83a36d939f0afaef
msgid ""
"This article covers general information related to magnetic interference."
msgstr "本文介绍与磁场干扰相关的常规信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:11
#: b5e61269018648739d07964b76a08429 bf15756e5ca24f248767a51fa1f91c8d
#: d63dbc97043e4c3086bafba1a8c9028e dd19c1b52c5a42df81c37e01f2d591aa
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:13
#: 056b0f0966dd423a8d822bb768dba0e1 1ee93ef673ca468c9ceab9f6308eded6
#: 5b364d34eada4720b669356f4ffe458e 666d60ded3234479894231af2d21a413
msgid ""
"Magnet Interference on a compass can have a serious impact on navigation on "
"all vehicle types."
msgstr "罗盘上的磁场干扰可对所有飞行器类型的导航产生严重影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:16
#: 1d0477a4c5014cc38f4bc320ea7b0848 2047798213f7409daf874a78bd4dd5e1
#: 98b774ebae7b4b6fb49dce357cac52e8 ef95402802ac4abb9a233e16d7f43796
msgid ""
"This article explains what hardware changes you can make to reduce magnetic "
"interference on the compass, along with supporting theoretical discussion. "
"Information on how to set-up your compass can be found on :ref:`Advanced "
"Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>`."
msgstr ""
"本文说明可以进行哪些硬件改动以减少罗盘上的磁场干扰，并附有相关理论讨论。关于如何设置罗盘，请参见 :ref:`Advanced Compass "
"Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:21
#: 055f839af64f46b087cecc69c09a2bf6
msgid ""
"On Copter magnetic interference can cause circling (also known as "
"\"toiletbowling\") in Loiter, RTL, AUTO flight modes."
msgstr "在多旋翼上，磁场干扰可能导致在 Loiter、RTL、Auto 飞行模式下出现绕圈飞行（也称为「马桶效应」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:23
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:25
#: 1566b10c4fa8411286d74ea0732e8fb9 36f48c3553e74bff80587aeb8797f446
#: 4a22dcf8e1b74eba8e7d721b81032315 93835c8b00144b2883e0aa23461cbc77
msgid ""
"See also `Magnetic Declination "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnetic_declination>`__ (wikipedia)"
msgstr ""
"另见 `磁偏角 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnetic_declination>`__ （维基百科）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:27
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:29
#: 284cbd9b2a8848fbb5fab2a1b90a09e8 4ef1469afb354c5a811c837800183cd4
#: 4f4ec3d734d34a02ad3a0cd7ce4ba41b cdbfe5f5e3024598871ad3b4c0a0a275
msgid "Hardware changes to reduce magnetic interference on the compass"
msgstr "减少罗盘磁场干扰的硬件改动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:29
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:31
#: 2923a53f83744f23a39ec8e56dba5bf9 336c1ade982b4b24b5c66c39c922307f
#: 911d608b22d643c98409f48d4e7c4021 fe1f59a15b0240a48bb6ef8121c504e5
msgid ""
"The best way method is to use an :ref:`external compass <common-external-"
"magnetometer-for-improved-performance>` or :ref:`GPS+Compass <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` module mounted on a mast up and "
"away from magnetic source of interference including the power distribution "
"board (PDB)."
msgstr ""
"最佳方式是使用安装在支架上、远离干扰磁场源（包括分电板 PDB）的 :ref:`外置罗盘 <common-external-magnetometer-"
"for-improved-performance>` 或 :ref:`GPS+罗盘 <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-"
"compass-module>` 模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:33
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:35
#: 0c288571641e42899a68f6ab8c6ced38 63afc193e1144a63bb03aaf427d152ac
#: 885953b61a8f41428d8677d10f65c941 ca035d46447848d199a1708ddb949120
msgid ""
"Keep the wires between the PDB, ESCs and battery as short as possible.  The "
"wires from the ESCs to the motors are less important because they are AC and"
" produce less interference."
msgstr "尽量缩短 PDB、ESC 和电池之间的连线。ESC 到电机的连线影响较小，因为它们是交流电，产生的干扰较少。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:36
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:38
#: 1a3cb54b62644b0a810a46a27dda3a36 224677faec1f490390778adb9b7012b5
#: 64d7dbb73e5c4fec9c3fa59166490ad9 e288bc5b725a41eb8cb7df613deea497
msgid ""
"Twist the wires between the PDB, ESC and battery and use grounded shielding "
"where possible."
msgstr "将 PDB、ESC 和电池之间的连线绞合，并在可能的情况下使用接地屏蔽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:40
#: 1f9dbc4c085a48e598f8f0d703748c63 252f5bf8bc354967be1339b650b3ce43
#: 32deb22a8ce6437e890765508a2e37c1 e1dcf46501ca472093e67fdb93e51454
msgid ""
"Replace the PDB and ESCs with a 4-in-1 ESC because they tend to produce less"
" interference probably because their wires are shorter and closer together "
"and they also have an aluminum plate on top which may help reduce the "
"interference."
msgstr ""
"将 PDB 和 ESC 替换为四合一 ESC，因为后者产生的干扰通常更少，这可能是因为其连线更短、更集中，而且顶部的铝板也可能有助于减少干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:42
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:44
#: 52971af5847e4d6084723de39d87cfc2 c48daf428b3d4e45bd7c20a11197654d
#: cd6b50acb39642768925467b06effe50 d2cbcd31086a404eac1b8d73612e76ad
msgid ""
"Add aluminum shielding (even gutter tape) around the wires from the ESC to "
"the motors may reduce the AC interference.  Aluminum will not help reduce "
"the primary DC interference from the PDB, ESCs and the wires connecting "
"them."
msgstr "在 ESC 到电机的连线外加铝屏蔽（甚至排水沟胶带）可能有助于减少交流干扰。铝对 PDB、ESC 及其连线产生的主要直流干扰没有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:51
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:53
#: 24bf5e653b404d74a670fbf149ac6a7a 2ac7628260ee4f0fa21642eea13bcf66
