#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:54
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:56
#: 0bf0acfec87c4375a87f7dcf128059b9 1596e853cd514d579bd5cfac698a9315
#: 5c8d3107da56460bba7447a22bb8ea50 ed388b40a3a5474e802b24229a60d110
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The application of the \\ `Biot-Savart law <http://hyperphysics.phy-astr.gs "
"u.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/biosav .html#c1>`__ on the centerline of a \\ "
"`current loop <http://hyperphysics.phy-astr.g "
"su.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/curlo o.html#c1>`__ involves integrating the "
"z-component."
msgstr ""
"在电流环轴线上应用 `比奥-萨伐尔定律 <http://hyperphysics.phy-astr.gs "
"u.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/biosav .html#c1>`__ 对 `电流环 "
"<http://hyperphysics.phy-astr.g su.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/curlo "
"o.html#c1>`__ 进行积分时，涉及对 z 分量的积分。"

