#: 9da52507d00942b0a41b169c3d65348c f243adbdfd374a8ba8dfd679856724e4
msgid ""
"There are 3 things to get from this drawing and the equation for the "
"magnetic field B as you move away from a current loop along the Z axis:"
msgstr "从该图及沿 Z 轴远离电流环时磁场 B 的方程，可以得出 3 点结论："

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:81
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:83
#: c9d4694df89d45f49ea71ba4025ca2ad d839032395dd415984da01f0e22b97ad
#: e5ac0fe826ab4693a2ed25fe65c3d7a8 e760b284218541218d82396f5e43479f
msgid ""
"The magnetic field increases as a function of the enclosed loop area Pi R^2"
msgstr "磁场随封闭回路面积 Pi R^2 的增大而增大"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:84
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:86
#: 03cec526fa0147b4a3fd377538699eb9 7a52628c0af8471e919058d947635353
#: c4c5ab6a67c3484aa5e4e375741d4d85 da0e62d5a0ba4c709e4e31490f7e6775
msgid "Big loop = big magnetic field"
msgstr "大回路 = 强磁场"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:85
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:87
#: 6f498eb7209e4f9ba55db2f9294d9ad7 773c90d6ead64b4bb7b51dcf4eb69494
#: a0140881d0194fd7a248407e85072c74 b201e3e38b674f1d8703f1c3a889b5b1
msgid ""
"Reduce the magnetic field by twisting the loop to close it. aka twist the "
"wires together and keep your return path close to the source"
msgstr "通过绞合回路（即将导线绞合在一起，并使回路与电流源尽量靠近）可以减小磁场"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:88
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:90
#: 51622f002336456ba7e570d699ae9d2d b02a1b5dfdd7423897b308c0a9029982
#: b5ee43d61cd447e389ad15fddc078056 c2a32ea3d92a4de384830759a5bd049a
msgid ""
"In the case where you have a PDB and 4 ESCs you have 4 loops that start at "
"the Deans connector on the PDB, go out to the ESC and return back to the "
"Deans connector.  In the case of the 4 in 1 ESC the current flow is much "
"more concentrated in one area and you don't have the big loops so "
"consequently you decrease the magnetic field."
msgstr ""
"在使用 PDB 和 4 个 ESC 的情况下，存在 4 个回路，从 PDB 上的 Deans 接头出发，延伸到 ESC 再返回 Deans "
"接头。对于四合一 ESC，电流更集中在一个区域，不存在大回路，因此磁场更小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:95
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:97
#: 1f1a043b59ea406cb720210a04df3786 434b39f2957043e2ae2dcfacd1ada11e
#: 4df68eeb55aa43abb05766b93dfa794d 63ebb403fd364ba9bee855ebd27ab27e
msgid "The magnetic field increases as a function of current"
msgstr "磁场随电流的增大而增大"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:97
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:99
#: 0b23db9b7e6d4c599bba4e88cb27f713 6c6bf0cbdf084b6b86a84a6b0382891b
#: 89813e9bac144b20a563c506844f4d94 afa68935c5d34023b62052f4ae4a38f8
msgid ""
"Where there is the option, you can deliver the same power and decrease the "
"magnetic field by increasing the voltage and decreasing the current."
msgstr "在可选择的情况下，通过提高电压、降低电流来输送相同功率，可以减小磁场。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:101
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:103
#: 404bfbf7261f4d04a3e11194322856be 6c98c19794cd4bb889864032b9abcc8f
#: 8a1804b1e5de454ab8cf69a66947be1f fb76935a5f294c53a683d94eabdf50de
msgid "The magnetic field decreases as a function of the cube of the distance"
msgstr "磁场随距离的三次方衰减"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:104
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:106
#: 10e7cd77312d418db589d183a737d642 4eabb4d4bd0547349d2c1c54d7736c30
#: 8999d297e9fb4e86aba178799aa83f53 9f7017988e33419294025376008dc438
msgid ""
"It is more complicated when you are close to the loop but when z >> R the "
"denominator goes to z^3"
msgstr "在靠近回路时情况更为复杂，但当 z >> R 时分母趋近于 z^3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:107
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:109
#: 8ad3a98fa5284bbf9bf7df013064fd9a 93aabd6319124e508737bc72f275495e
#: b83c4bccbd7c43479ba3f5eceb22a656 f936f2a2055c4589b90917bf8e9d976b
msgid ""
"There is one more thing and that is that the direction of the magnetic field"
" depends on the direction that the current flows so when you rotate a "
"battery it changes the magnetic field produced by the current flowing in the"
" battery."
msgstr "还有一点需要注意：磁场方向取决于电流流向，因此旋转电池会改变电池中电流产生的磁场。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:112
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:114
#: 0e59f202fde24964b0b1402b3c729273 29c33af2a1554946af6947c2cdb7c331
#: a059c4ae7eb147a2be215fa1e48b86e1 bb1ec63e3ef44177b742397aac13bff1
msgid ""
"It can't be stated enough that minimizing the enclosed loop areas and moving"
" the compass away from the current will help things work better and \"yes\","
" power distribution boards with big circular thick high current PC traces on"
" them produce significant semi-spherical fields as large or larger than "
"their diameter."
msgstr ""
"怎么强调都不为过：减小封闭回路面积并将罗盘远离电流，有助于提升性能。「是的」，带有大圆形粗走线高电流 PCB "
"走线的分电板会产生显著的半球形磁场，其范围等于或大于其直径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:119
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:121
#: 2450576832ae4c6a95998a1c5903e489 4595bbd297a2434aa20abcf0f387d681
#: c3a8f0ed8fdd4befa35a7d5efce03540 f9bb0a56c63c4de9ac728024e1235875
msgid "Natural and Artificial Magnetic Anomalies Warning"
msgstr "自然与人工磁场异常警告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:123
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:125
#: 3530e0185312431bbf69a0ac6a89a363 7314508dcc704bce93c3c77421660cff
#: db21458349a0480f9f5b53e58c373a0a fdaacd3be2ea4276ab54619a93d8f909
msgid ""
"The following information has not been objectively tested to determine its "
"impact on a vehicle's compass accuracy in flight."
msgstr "以下信息尚未经过客观测试，以确定其对飞行中飞行器罗盘精度的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:126
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:128
#: 1dd56e3055484d499a5d6605805a21ab 3a49a6c9ad1a446f9835d3ebcf39ceaf
#: 9f0e3e62f47a4ea2a5e042337744dd51 e6129df52957451493c140cbf7a5eb9f
msgid ""
"Many things can distort the earth's magnetic field in the area you are "
"flying:"
msgstr "许多因素可能会在您飞行的区域扭曲地球磁场："

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:129
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:131
#: 5c3f365b899e444195675e8314dc129f 7ee43a26e4d946d697a30988770a854d
#: 89e9253861f74b31819cd53846c001cc ea8a5f7612844807ac6473700b441fdc
msgid ""
"Steel framed or reinforced concrete buildings, bridges and roadways, iron "
"pipes and culverts, high power electric lines, heavy equipment, trucks and "
"automobiles, steel tanks, electric motors and even computers."
msgstr "钢框架或钢筋混凝土建筑、桥梁和道路、铁管和涵洞、高压电线、重型设备、卡车和汽车、钢罐、电动机甚至计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:133
#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:135
#: 04736082dbb64dc99cfdb0b3c87fc0fd 8473e1cfbe1d40bc84c5689e57bf6573
#: a401af80add242febdd574cb690f4163 eb7322a84d6e4882a0f8779706bf8e88
msgid ""
"Flying between steel framed or reinforced high rise buildings will distort "
"the magnetic field in addition to causing GPS multi-pathing."
